  "description": "Two schematic inverse-function graph panels: strictly increasing left, strictly decreasing right. Exact mirror geometry is required by the approved modern text, not measured from the scan. Original origin optical code point remains UNKNOWN; modern 0 explicitly annotates the mathematically zero local Cartesian intersection. No diagonal equation label, extra point markers, or endpoint inclusion claim is added.",
